@startuml
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Scheduler / Merchant Portal" as Cron
participant "Settlement Service" as SettleSvc
participant "Redis Cluster" as Redis
database "CockroachDB\n(Transactional)" as DB
participant "Banking Partner Switch\n(NPCI / Host)" as BankSwitch
participant "Audit Service" as Audit

== Step 1: Batch Assembly ==
Cron -> SettleSvc: Trigger Batch Settlement (cutoff window)
SettleSvc -> Redis: Acquire Lock 'lock:settlement:batch' (TTL 300s)
SettleSvc -> DB: Query unsettled merchant transactions (LIMIT 100,000)
DB --> SettleSvc: Return chunked batch payload

== Step 2: Reconciliation & Escrow Lock ==
SettleSvc -> DB: Update txn status to 'SETTLING' (Hold ledger locks)
SettleSvc -> SettleSvc: Compute net payout, MDR fee & TDS deductions

== Step 3: External Interbank Transfer ==
loop In Chunks of 1,000 txns
    SettleSvc -> BankSwitch: ISO 8583 / REST Payout Request
    alt Bank Switch Timeout (>30s)
        BankSwitch --> SettleSvc: 504 Gateway Timeout
        SettleSvc -> SettleSvc: Trigger Query Status Polling / Reversal
    else Settlement Success
        BankSwitch --> SettleSvc: Payout Confirmed (UTR Number)
    end
end

== Step 4: Final Ledger Posting & Audit ==
SettleSvc -> DB: Mark merchant_settlements 'COMPLETED'
SettleSvc -> DB: Write double-entry Escrow-to-Nodal bank entries
SettleSvc -> Audit: Stream Settlement Manifest to WORM S3
SettleSvc -> Redis: Release 'lock:settlement:batch'
@enduml